===Etymology 1===
{{etymid|fi|deaf}}
{{unc|fi}}. Somehow related to dialectal {{m|fi||kuurne}}, {{cog|et|kurt}}, {{cog|krl|kuurnis}}, {{cog|lud|kuurniž}}, {{cog|vep|kurdiž}} and {{cog|vro|kurt'}}, but the morphology is unclear, and no single form can be reconstructed. Has been considered a {{der|fi|bat}} borrowing (compare {{cog|lv|kurls||deaf}} and {{cog|lt|kurtus}}, {{m|lt|kurčias}}), but this is likewise uncertain.

====Adjective====
